We finish the meal.
"Let's clear the plates," Priya says.
I take the plates and water glasses.
I take them to the kitchen.
Priya makes hot chai.
Then she brings two cups of chai.
"Now we will eat dessert," she says.
She opens the sweet box.
I brought the Kaju Katli today.
Priya serves the Kaju Katli on a small plate.
"Let's drink the chai," Priya says with a smile.
We drink the chai and eat the sweet.
The Kaju Katli is very delicious.
The hot chai is also very good.
We sit happily.
'In Mumbai, I am finally building a real community,' I think.
'I now have good friends here,' I also think.
Tonight is very beautiful.
